{"author":{"id":"08468221db090fa9af39e58d6a9b2c05540151ac002b313cdfc0777721169c7d"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789641235,"nonce":"+ASNPiq7pYq9ZQXoF4B5gSJQcjI=","title":"Confirm the top-side 3D twin is framed correctly outside the 1440-wide desktop case:","message":"- 4:3 aspect (the card is not always 16:9)\n- a real phone viewport, including the Expo app\n\nLook for: rig cropped at the edges, labels colliding, legend overlapping the canvas, camera too far out.\n\nChrome automation quirk when screenshotting: the automation window reports `document.hidden`, so the\ntwin pauses. Before capture, override `document.hidden`/`visibilityState` to visible, replace\n`requestAnimationFrame` with `setTimeout(33)`, dispatch `visibilitychange`, nudge the canvas wrapper\nheight (98% then back) and wait 3 s. Normal visible windows render without this.\n\nFiles: `web/src/components/twin/` (Twin, layout, Labels, TwinLegend).","files":null}]}